      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Another nice to have feature on the camera would be for VRChat to automatically detect the user IDs or user names visible on the picture as well as the world ID the picture was taken in and embed that into the saved picture or a metadata .txt file that gets saved along with each picture. Would make managing tens of thousands of pictures a lot easier.",
